option! The Societas Philanthropia has accounted for all your burning desires with the most innovative robot they\u2019ve ever made.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466230/extras/10924ce675621ce74b3b67e1fbe2b09c.avif?t=1744940823\" width=800 height=78 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466230/extras/5fac7249b62547e6a712ca7da6bdc601.poster.avif?t=1744940823\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466230/extras/5fac7249b62547e6a712ca7da6bdc601.webm?t=1744940823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466230/extras/5fac7249b62547e6a712ca7da6bdc601.mp4?t=1744940823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different worlds as E.R.O. 4! Find different cultures and ways of life as you research planets for the Societias Philanthropia. Immerse yourself in the universe the Societias Philanthropia is creating, and discover their true intentions.</p>",
